{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10113010","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10113010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1011301001:0":{"text":"이 길을 따라가면 다프니 현자가 관리하시는 달빛호수 마을이에요. 마을 사람은 대부분 땅거미 파죠. ","source_cn":"沿着这条路就能到月湖村了，村里多是薄暮一派，由达赫妮贤...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC18DEF124148391F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1011301002:0":{"text":"오! 다프니 할머니 아직 정정하시지? 어릴 때 항상 날 우산으로 찌르곤 하셨는데!","source_cn":"喔！达赫妮婆婆身子还硬朗吗？记得小时候，她总用伞杖戳我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA5E1DE32F2B9956","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1011301003:0":{"text":"우, 우산... 어르신이 아주 위엄 있는 분인가 봐요?!","source_cn":"伞、伞杖……难道是位很有威严的老人家？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6FACE3B71BEFB5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1011301004:0":{"text":"오해입니다. 다프니 할머니께 로잔 님 같은 대우를 받은 사람은 그리 많지 않아요.","source_cn":"您误会了，能享受到洛桑大人那般待遇的人并不多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF88D285529D94B26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1011301005:0":{"text":"...이봐! 헛소문 퍼트리지 마! 마을의 장난꾸러기 중에서 다프니 할머니에게 혼나지 않았던 아이가 어디 있다고!","source_cn":"……喂！你不要谣传！村里调皮捣蛋的小孩，哪一个没被她训斥过！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04F4AC626669FBDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1011301006:0":{"text":"맞아요, 정곡을 찌르셨네요.","source_cn":"说得好，您真是一语中的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC405FD2594A22213","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布莱恩":{"text":"브라이언","source":"布莱恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":4}}